# Source images stay local. The app needs none of them -- the CLI and the web
# page both work on whatever picture you point them at -- and this repo is
# public, so personal photos and third-party artwork are deliberately kept out
# of it. The web app's own assets under web/ are committed explicitly below.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
!web/favicon.png

# Generated charts: each run writes a dated folder, tens of MB of PDF.
*-chart-*/
test-out-*/
page1-rebuild/

# Built site (recreated by `task build` and by the Pages workflow).
dist/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
